TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Ana Cadde’de yalnızca {{TAG:0005:0010:0001}} satan
yeni bir dükkân açılıyormuş!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Dışarıda oturup gönlünce {{TAG:0005:0010:0001}}
keyfi yapabilecekmişsin!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Vay, güzel!
Sana inanmıyorum.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}I've come up with one weird trick
that can help maintain your nice
complexion{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Just pick up {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}
and wait until it goes bad.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Then eat
it!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} It's good for your skin.{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
I'll try that!
I'm skeptical of this.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Ho inventato un sistema infallibile
per mantenere una pelle elastica.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Raccogli {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}
e aspetta che vada a male,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}infine
mangial{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Vedrai che risultati!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Farò un tentativo!
Sono un po' scettic{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Güzel bir cildi korumak için işe yarayan
tuhaf bir yöntem buldum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Bir {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}} alıp bozulana kadar bekle.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Sonra ye!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Cilde iyi geliyormuş.{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Deneyeceğim!
Pek ikna olmadım.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}You believed me? {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Did you know the word "gullible"
isn't even in the dictionary?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Das glaubst du mir sogar?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Du bist erstaunlich leicht
hereinzulegen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Bana inandın mı? {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}"Saf" kelimesinin sözlükte bile
olmadığını biliyor muydun?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aber wieso glaubst du mir das denn
nicht?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Also, mal abgesehen davon,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
dass es erlogen war, natürlich...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}E va bene,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} mi hai beccata.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}} Oggi sto
cercando di fare la birbantella.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
È solo per farsi quattro risate!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Erwischt!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}} Ich wollte nur einmal
testen, wie leichtgläubig du bist.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nicht sehr, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}wie man sieht!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Soy una gran defensora de la
honestidad, cielín, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}¡pero hoy es
el Día de las Bromas!
¡Mentir está a la orden del día!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
No te habrás enfadado, ¿verdad?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0027:}}
Ha sido sin mala intención.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Di solito considero la sincerità
una qualità fondamentale...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}... ma oggi è il primo aprile {{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}e posso
dire tutte le bugie che voglio!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Spero che tu non ci sia rimast{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
male.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Amic{{TAG:000E:0006:02006900040068006500}} come prima,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} va bene?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sì? {{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Meraviglioso!

DE:
Um ehrlich zu sein,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}kann ich nur
schwerlich die Unwahrheit sagen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aber ich übe noch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}} Haha!
